# Performance & SEO Rules

## Performance
- Avoid unnecessary client-side JS.
- Prefer SSG/static rendering for blog pages when possible.
- Use caching/revalidation appropriately for content reads.

## SEO
- Use Next.js metadata APIs.
- Blog list and post pages must set:
  - title
  - description
  - open graph basics
  - canonical (when appropriate)

## Content rendering safety
- If rendering markdown, avoid raw HTML injection unless sanitized.
- Prefer safe markdown rendering defaults.